	(text "Native USB: D- to GPIO18, D+ to GPIO19. Place R75/R76 near MCU.\nContact order from -X: GND / D- / D+ / 5V. Place U75 at contact entry.\nInternal J4 is before series resistors; do not connect two USB hosts simultaneously."
